<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Clears all 30 slots in your market in seconds. 1920 x 1080 FHD</Major>
    <Description>With this macro you can empty your market on GrandRP without any effort. The macro only needs 20 seconds to empty all 30 slots.

If you only want to empty rows 1, 2 and 5 for example, you can insert a “Go to” before the start of row 3 and skip to line 46, effectively skipping rows 3 and 4.

Depending on whether your system is strong and therefore has a fast response time or not, you can select all lines in the macro accordingly and change the time delays to meet your requirements.

The only working resolution: 1920  x 1080 FHD

I have also published a 2560 x 1440 WQHD version.

If you need help or have any suggestions on which macro I should create next, please let me know.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>//1st row
MoveTo 1045 302
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1300 120
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1413 -120
GoWhile 3 6
//2nd row
MoveTo 1045 388
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1300 120
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1413 -120
GoWhile 14 6
//3rd row
MoveTo 1045 468
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1300 120
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1413 -120
GoWhile 25 6
//4th row
MoveTo 1045 556
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1300 120
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1413 -120
GoWhile 36 6
//5th row
MoveTo 1045 631
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1300 120
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1413 -120
GoWhile 47 6</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>